		"How old a stamp may be when the phone or kiosk uploads it after an outage. Longer windows help over weekends; they also leave more room for wrong device clocks. 24 hours is the safe default." : "How old a stamp may be when the phone or kiosk uploads it after an outage. Longer windows help over weekends; they also leave more room for wrong device clocks. 24 hours is the safe default.",
