		"This time entry would exceed the maximum daily working hours of 10 hours (ArbZG §3) on %1$s (%2$s hours on that calendar day)." : "Denna tidrapportering skulle överskrida maximal daglig arbetstid på 10 timmar (ArbZG §3) den %1$s (%2$s timmar den kalenderdagen).",
		"This time entry would exceed the maximum daily working hours of 10 hours (ArbZG §3). Total daily hours would be %s hours." : "Denna tidsregistrering skulle överskrida maximal daglig arbetstid på 10 timmar (ArbZG §3). Total daglig arbetstid skulle bli %s timmar.",
